{"candidateAnswer":"- LGBTQ support group (7 May 2023)  \n- School event sharing transgender journey (early June 2023)  \n- LGBTQ+ counseling workshop (mid June 2023)  \n- LGBTQ+ pride parades (June 2023, July 2023, August 2023)  \n- LGBTQ conference (July 2023)  \n- Transgender poetry reading (October 2023)","evidence":"[D17:19 | 10:31 am on 13 October, 2023] Caroline: It was a transgender poetry reading where transgender people shared their stories through poetry. It was extra special 'cause it was a safe place for self-expression and it was really empowering to hear others share and celebrate their identities.\n[D15:13 | 3:19 pm on 28 August, 2023] Caroline: Wow! Did you see that band?","itemId":"urn:uuid:19a0e7ea-3ac4-5bcb-a2f3-814c55e3f7fe","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2b1eb283f3972444f3b733348eccbc3d4ef2ce073fae9cf7a3aac2a73656d3bb","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What transgender-specific events has Caroline attended?","referenceAnswer":"Poetry reading, conference","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2b1eb283f3972444f3b733348eccbc3d4ef2ce073fae9cf7a3aac2a73656d3bb"}}]}